 * POV (Point of View) determines which character's perspective the page shows.
 * This automatically informs rage, light, blood, breath, and doom aspects.
 *
 * If an aspect is not defined for a page, it will fall back to the default sprite.
 * You can override specific aspects per page as needed.
 */

